ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Wei is a diligent college student, he is in the library preparing for the final exam. The content of the exam is hard for him, so he decides to focus on studying. Suddenly, his good friend Li Hua sends a message, inviting him to a party on the weekend. Zhang Wei thinks for a while, because he has not seen his friends for a long time. But he thinks about the importance of the exam. His phone battery is low, he decides to plug in the charger. At this time, his girlfriend calls him, saying she is free in the evening, they can review together.\n\n[Question]\nAfter Zhang Wei finishes the call with his girlfriend, what does he do?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. He continues to review in the library.\nB. He turns off the phone to avoid being disturbed.\nC. He prepares to go to his girlfriend's place to review.\nD. He leaves the library to attend the friend's party.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0031725396434442213,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e06cd6006945d27fbdc6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367596113,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e7ac34a0bfec445cac2fd15a84d2a705"}